    "description": {
      "type": "/type/text",
      "value": "With Leafstar's encouragement, Sol, a former kittypet, has joined the ranks of SkyClan. He dreams of becoming a great warrior, and promises to be helpful and brave. But Leafstar soon begins to wonder if Sol respects the rules of the warrior code. And when Sol's actions lead to a perilous disaster for SkyClan, Leafstar has to figure out whether he can be trusted‒before it's too late.\r\n\r\n\r\n----------\r\n**Books in this series**\r\n\r\n 1. [The Rescue][1]\r\n 2. Beyond the Code\r\n 3. [After the Flood][3]\r\n\r\n  [1]: https://openlibrary.org/works/OL17457584W\r\n  [3]: https://openlibrary.org/works/OL17496555W"
